# Demo run output — every run (dev or reviewer) writes a local, date-stamped transcript; never shipped.
demos/sprint-1/outputs/answers-mahy.md
demos/*/outputs/*-mahy.md
demos/sprint2/outputs/*.md
# Demo backend fixtures (mirror real backend data — local only)
demos/sprint2/backend_fixtures.yaml
# Demo-generated visuals — committed so a reviewer can view them (overrides `artifacts/` above)
!demos/sprint2/outputs/artifacts/
!demos/sprint2/outputs/artifacts/**
# The published Sprint-2 demo transcript (the one saved run kept for review; other runs stay ignored)
!demos/sprint2/outputs/demo-output.md

